        <headline>Flash Flood Warning issued September 25 at 1:11AM MDT until September 25 at 1:15AM MDT by NWS El Paso Tx/Santa Teresa NM</headline>
        <description>The heavy rain has ended. Flood waters have receded. Flooding is no
longer expected to pose a threat. Please continue to heed remaining
road closures.

A Flood Watch remains in effect until 600 AM MDT for a portion of
south central New Mexico.
</description>
